Hello everyone,

Our initial version is now available in Early Access! We have a level and seven of the eight projectile types available to play with.

Known issues include:

 The anti-gravity projectile is not unlockable - it still needs work before we are happy with it;
 Some UI inconsistencies - mainly in the tutorial;
 The mouse sensitivity by default is very high - this can be adjusted in the settings.


We will be releasing updates regularly to introduce new features and content. In the near future, we are planning to have:

 Another, larger level called Hudson City;
 The anti-gravity projectile working as we want and included in the game;
 General bug fixes.


Thanks to all of you for your support and we hope you enjoy Megaton: Total Destruction!

